{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51853","headline":"平盖山 · 无名氏","name":"平盖山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平盖山高古木疎，昔人曾此筑仙居。\n井通八角寒泉涌，观毁三清劫火余。\n洗墨池边丹竈冷，系龙岩畔石潭虚。\n吟成独坐荒苔上，闲看蜗牛学篆书。\n（《蜀中名胜记》十二《眉州彭山县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}